; Claudia caption template for 1080x1920 shorts. Edit the [Events] lines; keep the styles.
; Colours are &HAABBGGRR: off-white #ece9e2 = &H00E2E9EC, rose #ff6fa5 = &H00A56FFF, near-black #0a0b0d = &H000D0B0A.
; Fonts (SIL OFL): Barlow Condensed ExtraBold, DM Sans Bold, DM Mono Medium — put the .ttf files in the fontsdir you pass to ffmpeg.
; Positions: \an5 = centred anchor. Hook at y=520 (upper-middle, below the top UI), captions at y=1180 (above the
; bottom ~560 px of app UI on every platform), label at y=360. Nothing goes right of x=960 or below y=1500.
; Burn: sh ../../short-form-editing/scripts/burn-captions.sh in.mp4 captions.ass out.mp4 fonts/   (needs ffmpeg with libass)
